    "result_text": "The implementation is complete and the test suite is green (`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` / `BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI released version 2 of the owner identity. The change centers on a single new concept \u2014 `model/OwnerIdentityVersion` \u2014 that holds the `CURRENT` version number (2) and the fixed `TAG` (`\"V2\"`) mixed into every identifier. Each identifier mixes the tag in idiomatically, and each derived value has a single, well-scoped home:\n\n**Identity derivation (tag mixed in \u2192 every identifier changes, no v1 value recurs):**\n- `MemberIdGenerator` region \u2014 `ClinicServiceImpl` now builds the region as `Locality.forOwner(owner) + \"V2\"`, so `memberId` becomes e.g. `NSWV226...`.\n- `OwnerIdentity.key` \u2014 prepends `V2|` to the SHA-256 input.\n- `Households.householdId` \u2014 prepends `V2|` to the SHA-256 input.\n\n**User-facing values stay plain (no tag):**\n- `OwnerMapper.formatLocality` now derives the plain region directly via `Locality.forOwner` instead of parsing it back out of the (now-tagged) `memberId`. `timezone` and the owner segment follow from that plain locality, so `locality` stays `NSW` and the segment stays `..._METRO`. The now-dead `Locality.fromMemberId` was removed.\n\n**Response shape (`openapi.yml` \u2192 regenerated DTOs):**\n- Added a new `OwnerIdentity` schema grouping `memberId`, `householdId`, `identityKey`; the `Owner` schema now exposes them only under a nested `identity` object plus a top-level integer `apiVersion` (2). The mapper builds the nested object in a small `toIdentity` helper.\n\n**Audit schema v2:**\n- `OwnerCreatedEvent` gained `schemaVersion` (2) and an `ownerSegment` recomputed from the v2 identity using the plain region and membership level \u2014 matching the segment in the owner response.\n\nRequest fields (`OwnerFields`) were left untouched, as required. Confirmed via the emitted audit line: `{\"schemaVersion\":2,...,\"memberId\":\"NSWV22616E6609E9\",...,\"ownerSegment\":\"STANDARD_METRO\",\"event\":\"OWNER_CREATED\"}`.",
